</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The time past of our lives</l><l>Sufficeth to have wrought</l><l>The fleshly will, which only ill</l><l>Hath to us ever brought.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>No longer is our life</l><l>A thing unused or vain;</l><l>To us e’en here to live is Christ,</l><l>To us to die is gain.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Our life is hid with Christ,</l><l>With Christ in God above,</l><l>Upward our heart would go to Him,</l><l>Whom, seeing not, we love.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>He liveth, and we live!</l><l>His life for us prevails;</l><l>His fulness fills our mighty void,</l><l>His strength for us avails.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
